  "result": "The number is computed in `nextIssueNumber` in `src/server/repositories/issue-repository.ts`. It takes the maximum `number` over every issue row with the same `orgId` and `projectId`, archived ones included, and adds 1. An empty project therefore starts at 1. Because the query is scoped by project, projects in the same organization each count from 1 independently.\n\n`createIssue` in `src/server/services/issue-service.ts` only calls `nextIssueNumber` and passes the result to `insertIssue`. It doesn't compute the number, so I've left it out of the answer.\n\nANSWER: src/server/repositories/issue-repository.ts",
